# Implementation workflow

## Autonomy

- Do not ask unnecessary questions if the answer is in the code, `AGENTS.md`, or issues.
- Use reasonable defaults; ask only for real product decisions.
- Run commands, checks, and tests yourself — do not stop with “ask the user”.

## Bun

- **Bun only** (`bun install`, `bun run`, `bun test`) — not npm/yarn/pnpm.

## Code

- **No legacy** — when changing stack, remove old deps, files, compose services in the same change.
- **Minimal diff** — do not touch unrelated code.
- **Commits** — only when the user explicitly asks.
- **Imports** — cross-directory: `@/…` from project root (`tsconfig.json` `paths` + Nuxt alias). Same-folder `./` OK. Exception: `nuxt.config.ts` — relative `./` only (loaded before aliases). Nuxt `css: ["~/assets/…"]` keeps `~/`.

## `.env`

- **Read and edit** `.env` yourself when needed for dev (keys, `DATABASE_URL`, `TELEGRAM_LOGIN_*`, `BASE_URL`).
- **Do not commit** `.env` — only `.env.example` in git, no secrets.
- Shell does not load `.env` automatically → `bun --env-file=.env test` or `bun run dev` (Nuxt loads it).
- Dev HTTPS: `make tunnel` (cloudflared). **Not localtunnel.** See [`.docs/technical-design.md`](.docs/technical-design.md).

## DB migrations

- Schema changes **only** via incremental migrations: `db:generate` → `db:migrate`.
- **Forbidden:** `DROP SCHEMA`, truncate, rebuilding `0000_init.sql` to “refresh” an existing DB, `db:reset` script.
- Policy: [`.docs/database-migrations.md`](.docs/database-migrations.md).

## Operator CLI

- New **manual** prod ops commands → subcommand in `scripts/cli.ts` (`commander`), logic in `server/core/operator/` or reuse `server/` services/repos.
- Build: `bun run build:cli` → `.output/cli.cjs`; Docker copies to `/usr/local/bin/cli`.
- Docs: `.docs/deploy.md` (Operator CLI section), for billing — `.docs/billing-design.md`; locally `bun run cli -- …`.

## Tests

When changing `server/**` — see `unit-tests` rule (separate glob).

## Logging (`server/**`)

When changing `logger.*` in `server/**`:

- **debug** — frequent operational trace (updates, LLM prompt/response, lookups); **info** — rare business events (moderation outcome, webhook lifecycle).
- At `LOG_LEVEL=info`, one moderated message → a few info lines, not step-by-step trace.
- LLM prompts/responses **debug** only; no `"Debug:"` prefix — pick the right level.
- Policy: [`.docs/logging.md`](.docs/logging.md).

## i18n (admin UI)

When changing **user-facing UI** (`pages/`, `components/`, `layouts/`, client composables):

- Strings only via **`$t()` / `t()`** — keys in `i18n/locales/en.json` + **parity** in `ru.json`.
- Naming: nested JSON, dot keys (`nav.bots`, `bot.chats.addChat`, `common.save`).
- Document title: `usePageTitle(() => t('page.*.documentTitle'))`; app name — `useAppName()` (`APP_NAME` env).
- Breadcrumbs: translated `label` from `t()`, not literals.
- In locale JSON: escape literal `{user_mention}`, `@username` — see [`.docs/i18n.md`](.docs/i18n.md).
- After locale edits: `bun test tests/unit/i18n/locale-key-parity.test.ts` + `bun run build`.
- **Do not translate:** per-bot warn/ban templates, `RULE_TEMPLATES`, API `statusMessage`, release note bodies.
- README: edit **`README.md` and `README.ru.md`** together (not the same as `i18n/locales/`).

## Design system (admin UI)

- **Source of truth:** [`assets/brand/DESIGN.md`](assets/brand/DESIGN.md) (vendored from `site/brand` + Appendix A for moderation action colors).
- **CSS:** `assets/css/main.css` imports `assets/brand/css/theme.css` + `theme-app.css`. Docker/CI use committed files — no `brand/` symlink.
- **Local dev:** optional junction `brand/` → `../site/brand` (gitignored). Sync upstream CSS: `bun scripts/sync-brand-css.mjs`; favicons: `bun scripts/sync-brand-public.mjs`.
- **Tokens:** use `bg-surface-*`, `text-fg*`, `border-line`, Tailwind `text-xs`–`text-4xl` (see `DESIGN.md` §4), `tm-page-title` / `tm-section-title` for headings, `rounded-control` / `rounded-card` — **not** stock Tailwind `gray-*`, `blue-*`, `bg-white`, legacy `text-body` / `text-heading-*`, or arbitrary `text-[Npx]`.
- **Components:** prefer `components/ui/*` (`UiAppButton`, `UiAppCard`, …) over inline utility soup.
- **Theme:** `data-theme` on `<html>`, storage key `tm-theme`, toggle in header. Anti-flash script in `nuxt.config.ts` head.

### Icons — Lucide only (`lucide-vue-next`)

**All UI icons** in `components/` and `pages/` come from **Lucide** — tree-shakable Vue components.

**Do**

- Named import: `import { ArrowRight } from "lucide-vue-next"`
- Default props (brand `DESIGN.md` §10 — outline, monochrome): `size`, `stroke-width: 1.5`, `absolute-stroke-width`
- Colour via Tailwind on the icon: `class="text-fg-muted"` (`currentColor`)

**Don't**

- Inline `<svg>` in components (except `BrandMark.vue` and logo geometry)
- Other icon libraries (Iconify, Heroicons, Font Awesome, …)
- Filled/solid variants unless explicitly required

**Exceptions:** `BrandMark.vue`; synced brand assets under `public/{dark,light}/`.
